00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:56.980
We hear repeteadly from various characters

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:57.880
throughout the series that

00:02:57.880 --> 00:02:59.600
Jon's personality resembles

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:01.500
that of a Stark FAR more

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:04.020
than any of Ned's other true born children

00:03:04.020 --> 00:03:05.460
except for maybe Aria

00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:06.780
So? Who are our suspects?

00:03:06.780 --> 00:03:07.940
Ned himself tells us

00:03:07.940 --> 00:03:09.580
the mother's name is a woman named

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:10.080
